            "body": "<ul>\n<li>Settings (not finished)\n<ul>\n<li>Sidebar icons (only with the Vencord plugin \"ThemeAttributes\")</li>\n<li>My account tab</li>\n<li>Invites tab</li>\n<li>Privacy tab</li>\n<li>Family tab (will probably not be 100% skinned as i probably don't see a few pages of it)</li>\n<li>Devices tab</li>\n<li>Gift Inventory tab</li>\n<li>Language tab (only with the Vencord plugin \"ThemeAttributes\")</li>\n<li>Emoji tab</li>\n<li>Channel permissions tab (not finished)</li>\n<li>General improvements</li>\n<li>Small sidebar when using a vertical monitor (like the memberlist)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>ServerProfile plugin support</li>\n<li>Emoji autocomplete popup over chat input</li>\n<li>Addon grid adjustments (Themes/Plugin page)</li>\n<li>Source code improvement (the performance should also have gotten a boost)</li>\n<li>Improvement\n<ul>\n<li>Emoji/Sticker/Gif picker has been reduced in height by 100px</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Bug fixes\n<ul>\n<li>Game group invite</li>\n<li>Message input when messages editing</li>\n<li>Gap at the chat input left when there is no upload button</li>\n<li>White shadow under the chat scrollbar</li>\n<li>When opening or loading pages, the Discord standard background color was displayed</li>\n<li>Setting page bottom margin</li>\n<li>Discover sidebar</li>\n<li>Thread create sidebar</li>\n<li>Emoji chat button was cut off</li>\n<li>If a Spotify song title was too long it went through the button in the user modal</li>\n<li>Inbox and Pins note badge</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/SpaceEnergy/SpaceEnergy.github.io/commit/0795b627f86195a53884b3c38cf8c144044740ac\">Full Changelog</a></strong></p>",
